00:53:10.980 --> 00:53:13.020
that you wouldn't be able to
get if you just defined it

00:53:13.020 --> 00:53:14.767
as a kind of a medical issue, right?

00:53:14.767 --> 00:53:19.767
You could get the world
behind these global datasets

00:53:21.236 --> 00:53:25.440
that allow us to track
various interventions

00:53:25.440 --> 00:53:28.110
'cause the brain is the most
complex organ in the body.

00:53:28.110 --> 00:53:29.850
In order to decode it,

00:53:29.850 --> 00:53:34.200
you need data on the size
that you've never seen before.

00:53:34.200 --> 00:53:37.290
Ironically, back to this narrative piece,

00:53:37.290 --> 00:53:39.690
JFK did the race to space.

