00:54:19.584 --> 00:54:22.240
And I just think that

00:54:23.280 --> 00:54:26.580
the space station concept

00:54:26.580 --> 00:54:29.451
where the world sees its
kind of combined interest

00:54:29.451 --> 00:54:31.590
would be a great kind of,

00:54:31.590 --> 00:54:33.990
because for us to be saved in America,

